<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif', position: 'relative' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 1280, height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 60px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>需求从哪里来：范围、清单与评审闭环</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#BFD0EA' }}>01 · 需求分析</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 96, width: 1160, height: 106, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', padding: '0 28px', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', letterSpacing: 1 }}>需求基线</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>需求清单 V1.1 在 V1.0 的 20 条功能需求上逐条标注修改点；15 条非功能需求每条都带验证方式；6 条评审意见全部有处理决定。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 218, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 300, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 64, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>20</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>条功能需求</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>FR-01 ～ FR-20</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 300, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 64, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>15</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>条非功能需求</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>性能 / 安全 / 可靠性 / 可用性 / 兼容性</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 300, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 64, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>3</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>条质量与交付要求</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>QR-01 ～ QR-03，单列不并入功能</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 372, width: 560, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>范围之外，9 项明确不做</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>人脸识别、物联网设备控制、3D 场景、智能推荐、周期／批量预约、多级审批、消息推送、统一身份认证对接、移动端原生应用。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>写进文档，也不画进任何图表——避免"综合管理"式的模糊口径。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 700, top: 372, width: 520, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>三条编号纪律</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>① 条目只改状态不重编号；删掉的条目保留行、写明去向<br />② 评审提了但决定不改的，也留一行（R-06）<br />③ 同一条规则在角色说明、用例规约、需求清单里写成同一句话</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 566, width: 1160, height: 66, background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 24px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230' }}>需求可验收的标准不是"写全了"，而是每条都能被一个用例和一次测试命中。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 660, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>智能会议室管理系统 V1.0 · 第 4 组答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>04 / 20</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
